# KaziPesa Digital (business/)
# The brand config is a checked-in template that the owner edits and re-runs
# setup.py with - it is not a secret, so it overrides the global config.json rule.
!business/brand/config.json
# Cached state from the last setup.py run
business/brand/.last-applied.json
# Customer data: sales and outreach logs stay on the owner's machine
business/ops/ledger.csv
business/ops/outreach.csv
